# Terraform
**/.terraform/
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
*.tfplan
terraform.tfvars
*.auto.tfvars

# Lambda build artifacts
lambda/**/__pycache__/
lambda/**/*.pyc
lambda/**/*.zip
terraform/modules/lambda/builds/*.zip
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# IDE
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp

# Secrets
*.pem
*.key
.env
.env.*

# Execution files
EXECUTION*

# Local docs and notes. Narrowed 2026-11-08: a blanket docs/ rule is why
# week 1's screenshots were never in the repo, while every other week
# tracks its own. Notes stay out; the published evidence goes in.
docs/*
!docs/blog/
docs/blog/*
!docs/blog/screenshots/

# Removed 2026-11-08: BLOG*, embed* and LINKEDIN* lived here, unanchored.
# Everything they matched (docs/blog-notes.md, docs/embed_screenshots.py,
# docs/blog/blog-blogger.html) is already ignored by the docs rules above,
# and because the last matching pattern wins, BLOG* was re-excluding
# docs/blog/ and defeating the screenshots negation. docs/linkedin/ is
# guarded repo-wide by the root .gitignore.
